    "data": [
        {
            "title": "廣汽籌劃發A股購一汽整車公司部分權益 A股續停牌 H股今復牌",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">廣汽集團(02238)公布，正籌劃重大資產重組，涉及發A股購買一汽持有的某整車合資公司部分股權，並會募集配套資金。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"廣汽集團官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/12/02238-Web.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"廣汽集團官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/12/02238-Web.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">廣汽集團官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">該公司表示，為促進地方國企與央企產業資源優化整合，提升公司經營效益，已於9月14日(周一)與一汽簽署意向協議，擬發A股向一汽收購資產。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">經初步測算，在交易完成後，一汽將成為廣汽第2大和具有戰略影響力的股東；交易不構成廣汽實際控制中變更，不構成重組上市。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">現時上述交易尚處籌劃階段，存在不確定性，但為保證公平信息披露，避免股價異常波動，廣汽A股(0601238.SH)自9月14日開市起停牌，預計停牌時間不超過10個A股交易日；廣汽H股則於今早復牌。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16766838-%e5%bb%a3%e6%b1%bd%e7%b1%8c%e5%8a%83%e7%99%bca%e8%82%a1%e8%b3%bc%e4%b8%80%e6%b1%bd%e6%95%b4%e8%bb%8a%e5%85%ac%e5%8f%b8%e9%83%a8%e5%88%86%e6%ac%8a%e7%9b%8a-a%e8%82%a1%e7%ba%8c%e5%81%9c%e7%89%8c-h",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/12/20241202_FI_source-web_02238-2.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 08:37:33",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "黑期高水逾50點 重磅港股ADR幾全高收",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">新加坡黑期於今早約8時19分升96點或0.38%，報24,972點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股ADR指數報24,949點，較香港上日現貨收市高31點或0.13%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230808_FI_source-ap_港股1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230808_FI_source-ap_港股1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">騰訊(00700)ADR收市折合每股港幣432.9元，較上日香港收市高2.33元或0.54%；阿里巴巴(09988)ADR收市折合每股港幣107.1元，較上日香港收市高1.19元或1.12%。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美團(03690)ADR收市折合每股港幣75.3元，較上日香港收市高0.24元或0.32%；京東(09618)ADR收市折合每股港幣106.9元，較上日香港收市高0.9元或0.85%；小米(01810)ADR收市折合每股港幣27.3元，較上日香港收市高0.1元或0.38%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：騰訊官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/bplib_20230703-101229__source-web_00700.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：騰訊官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/bplib_20230703-101229__source-web_00700.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：騰訊官網</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滙控(00005)ADR收市折合每股港幣163元，較上日香港收市低1.86元或1.13%；友邦(01299)ADR收市折合每股港幣75.5元，較上日香港收市高0.1元或0.13%；港交所(00388)ADR收市折合每股港幣397.6元，較上日香港收市高0.16元或0.04%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：滙控官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/20230829_FI_source-web_HSBC-sign-Paris.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：滙控官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/04/20230829_FI_source-web_HSBC-sign-Paris.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：滙控官網</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">中國平安(02318)ADR收市折合每股港幣54.2元，較上日香港收市高0.6元或1.11%；建設銀行(00939)ADR收市折合每股港幣9.9元，較上日香港收市高0.04元或0.35%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒指期貨夜市收報25,028點，升155點，較上日恒指收市24,917點，高水110點。科指期貨夜市收報4,362點，較上日科指收市高水44點；國指期貨夜市收報8,334點，較上日國指收市高水49點。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16766829-%e9%bb%91%e6%9c%9f%e9%ab%98%e6%b0%b4%e9%80%be50%e9%bb%9e-%e9%87%8d%e7%a3%85%e6%b8%af%e8%82%a1adr%e5%b9%be%e5%85%a8%e9%ab%98%e6%94%b6",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/02/ADR-1_source-bp_-2-1.png.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 08:23:14",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "日韓股市初段續偏軟 日經暫微跌不足40點 韓股跌逾0.6%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">日韓股市初段繼續偏軟，AI發展放緩與加息等憂慮仍困擾市場。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/20241128_FI_source-ap_Japan_Financial_Markets.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/11/20241128_FI_source-ap_Japan_Financial_Markets.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">截至香港時間上午約8時18分，日經平均指數跌37點或0.06%，報63,455點。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">南韓首爾綜合指數暫跌44點或0.66%，報6,640點。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16766817-%e6%97%a5%e9%9f%93%e8%82%a1%e5%b8%82%e5%88%9d%e6%ae%b5%e7%ba%8c%e5%81%8f%e8%bb%9f-%e6%97%a5%e7%b6%93%e6%9a%ab%e5%be%ae%e8%b7%8c%e4%b8%8d%e8%b6%b340%e9%bb%9e-%e9%9f%93%e8%82%a1%e8%b7%8c%e9%80%be0-6",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/04/20260401_FI_source-ap_KS.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 08:23:14",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "美元指數創約兩星期新高",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美元指數表現強勁，盤中一度攀升至99.735，漲幅超過0.6%，刷新約兩星期的最高水平，尾市則在99.47附近徘徊。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">非美貨幣方面，歐元兌美元於1.155水平附近徘徊；英鎊兌美元則在1.35水平陷入爭持；美元兌日圓報154.33。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">至於商品貨幣表現相對穩健，澳元兌美元貼近0.714，新西蘭元兌美元則報0.578左右。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16766593-%e7%be%8e%e5%85%83%e6%8c%87%e6%95%b8%e5%89%b5%e7%b4%84%e5%85%a9%e6%98%9f%e6%9c%9f%e6%96%b0%e9%ab%98",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/12/20240410_source-licensed_USD_FB.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 08:17:17",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "油價曾再飆約5%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">國際油價再度急升。沙特有能源設施再度受到攻擊，加上中東有船隻遇襲，市場對能源供應的擔憂隨之加劇，帶動兩大基準油價一度大幅抽升。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">倫敦布蘭特期油11月合約一度迫近每桶110美元關口，高見109.8美元，升幅約5%；其後升勢收窄，收報105.68美元，升幅縮至1%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">紐約期油10月合約同樣造好，最多升約4.9%，高見104.95美元，創近4個月高位；收報101.39美元，升逾1.3%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">美國總統特朗普表示，伊朗希望與美方達成協議，油價其後升幅收窄。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16766590-%e6%b2%b9%e5%83%b9%e6%9b%be%e5%86%8d%e9%a3%86%e7%b4%845",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/03/8a6d6fb35c89d9b0db4c4846f290c2c3_Iran_US_Oil_Prices_19824_FB.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 08:17:18",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "金價失守4300美元　曾觸及逾1個月低位",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">金價跌至逾1個月新低。油價急升及美國通脹數據均提升市場對聯儲局加息預期，不利金價表現。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">現貨金失守每盎司4,300美元水平，一度跌至4,252.59美元，跌約2.2%，較早時徘徊4,296美元附近。紐約期金12月合約收報4,351.9美元，跌約1.3%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16766587-%e9%87%91%e5%83%b9%e5%a4%b1%e5%ae%884300%e7%be%8e%e5%85%83%e3%80%80%e6%9b%be%e8%a7%b8%e5%8f%8a%e9%80%be1%e5%80%8b%e6%9c%88%e4%bd%8e%e4%bd%8d",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20241017_CR_source-licensed_gold_FB.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 08:15:46",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "歐洲股市普遍向下　顧慮AI發展放緩預期及通脹走勢",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">歐洲主要股市普遍向下，人工智能發展放緩的預期與通脹憂慮夾擊市場情緒，加上油價再度飆升及全球債息上揚，進一步抑制投資者的風險偏好。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">區內股市以意大利及西班牙表現最弱，跌幅同樣超過1%。德國DAX指數收報25,440點，跌127點，跌幅0.5%；法國CAC指數收報8,117點，跌61點，跌幅約0.8%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">英國富時100指數逆市造好，收報10,697點，升47點，升幅逾0.4%，連續兩個交易日高收。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16766556-%e6%ad%90%e6%b4%b2%e8%82%a1%e5%b8%82%e6%99%ae%e9%81%8d%e5%90%91%e4%b8%8b%e3%80%80%e9%a1%a7%e6%85%aeai%e7%99%bc%e5%b1%95%e6%94%be%e7%b7%a9%e9%a0%90%e6%9c%9f%e5%8f%8a%e9%80%9a%e8%84%b9%e8%b5%b0%e5%8b%a2",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250318_FI_source-ap_Britain_Financial_Markets-1.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 08:15:47",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "美國10年期債息曾升穿5厘　近3年來首次",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">在聯儲局議息會議召開前，美債孳息率持續攀升，市場普遍預期聯儲局本周將會加息。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">10年期債息一度突破5厘關口，為近3年以來首次，高見5.0142厘，升3.9個基點，尾市徘徊4.997厘附近。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">30年期債息高見5.3858厘，升約3.2個基點。一般與聯儲局利率預期同步波動的兩年期債息亦曾觸及逾兩年高位，升至4.679厘，升3.5個基點。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/16766550-%e7%be%8e%e5%9c%8b10%e5%b9%b4%e6%9c%9f%e5%82%b5%e6%81%af%e6%9b%be%e5%8d%87%e7%a9%bf5%e5%8e%98%e3%80%80%e8%bf%913%e5%b9%b4%e4%be%86%e9%a6%96%e6%ac%a1",
            "image": "https://image.bastillepost.com/704x369/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20190902_FI_TREASURY_BONDS_BOND_US-BONDS_US-BOND_FB-1-2-1-1-1-1_source-web_-1-2-1.jpg.webp",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-15 08:15:47",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "韓國交易所延長交易時間至晚上八時",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">韓國交易所周一正式推出收市後交易時段，容許投資者在常規市場收市後，買賣合資格股票至晚上八時。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">常規交易時間維持不變，為上午九時至下午三時半。在新制度下，投資者可在常規市場收市後，繼續買賣合資格股票至晚上八時。</p>\n<!-- slider begin -->\n<div class=\"fancy-slider\">\n<p class=\"fancy-gallery-tips\" style=\"font-weight: bold;font-size: 18px; margin: 0\">點擊看圖輯</p>\n<div class=\"fancy-main\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/09/screenshot_8499111_05.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/09/screenshot_8499111_05.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/09/screenshot_8499111_06.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/09/screenshot_8499111_06.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-main__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<a class=\"fancy-main__slide\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"slider-gallery\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/09/screenshot_8499111_03.jpeg.webp\">\n<div class=\"fancy-main__image\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/644x392/wp-content/uploads/ho